  "transcript": {
    "text": "My latest holiday was when I went to Valencia to raise the 70.3. I travelled there on Thursday and I raised on Sunday. The race went well. I swam 1.9 kilometres in just under 26 minutes, biked 90 kilometres in just over two hours, and ran a half marathon in one hour and 12 minutes. I finished in 20 second place overall, which was pretty low, considering my performance. I was travelling there with three other guys from the triathlon club. That was Frederick, Vendermar and Bestium. We stayed in Airbnb and we made food together, chilled out, spoke a lot about triathlon. After the race, we went out for pizza and explored Valencia a little bit. Found a really good pizza place. Then on Sunday, it was on Monday, sorry, it was time to come home. We took the metro from Valencia to the airport, and we flew direct home with Norwegian."
